    "id": "neuromancer-world",
    "name": "Neuromancer",
    "description": "William Gibson’s cyberpunk novel follows console cowboy Case from Night City through a corporate data theft, an orbital heist, and a struggle between two artificial intelligences. Molly’s physical infiltration and Case’s matrix run converge inside Villa Straylight, where memory, engineered identity, addiction, and machine agency become inseparable.",
